  (limitation "11 finite predeclared witnesses. that the SoC precedent implements it is the selection's reasoning: no FU540 is run; the U54's A and D behaviour is REQ-D-SVADE's, and this case takes no position on it; S is the only mode translated here, and ASIDs are not exercised")
